WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.877
The main menu decides the order of the links at the top of your site. Here we move one link.

2
00:00:07.877 --> 00:00:13.755
Open the Main navigation menu. Each link has a handle on its left.

3
00:00:13.755 --> 00:00:23.159
Drag Blog above Features by its handle. A message reminds you that the change is not saved yet.

4
00:00:23.159 --> 00:00:30.300
Click Save. The new order shows on the site straight away.
